<title>USA: Goldstein to join Lehman as senior trader.</title>
<headline>Goldstein to join Lehman as senior trader.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>David Goldstein, formerly of Citicorp Securities Inc, is slated to join Lehman Brothers as a senior trader on Tuesday, municipal market sources said Monday.</p>
<p>Stan Ciemniecki, a managing director who heads Lehman Brothers' municipal and public finance department, could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>Comment could also not be obtained immediately from Citicorp.</p>
<p>The Bond Buyer's Municipal Marketplace directory listed Goldstein as a vice president on Citicorp's municipal arbitrage desk.</p>
<p>--Kathie O'Donnell, 212-859-1650</p>
